OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FDr Pelly sees regular patient
OL,7,     FDavid who is suffering from the
OL,8,     Frepercussions of mouth cancer.
OL,9,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,10,     FBarnsley's A&E department is put
OL,11,     Funder the microscope. Advanced
OL,12,     FNurse Practitioner Dave tries to
OL,13,     Fget to the bottom of a patient's
OL,14,     Fpuzzling symptom - her tongue has
OL,15,     Fturned black!
OL,16,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,17,     FPatients include a man with
OL,18,     Flife-threatening brain injuries
OL,19,     Ffrom a punch, a 22-year-old with
OL,20,     Fpossible internal injuries after a
OL,21,     Fmotorbike crash, and an
OL,22,     F81-year-old with a head injury.
