OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FThe staff and patients of
OL,7,     FBarnsley's A&E department are put
OL,8,     Funder the microscope. The hospital
OL,9,     Fis two porters down, marking a big
OL,10,     Fproblem for Sister Jane.
OL,11,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,12,     FTwo grooms-to-be come to the
OL,13,     Fclinic with lumps they want to get
OL,14,     Frid of before their big days: Carl
OL,15,     Fhas multiple lipomas, while Alan
OL,16,     Fneeds a neck cyst removed.
OL,17,G0335 Home and Away
OL,18,     FAlf's heart is breaking over his
OL,19,     Fmissing daughter. The Fowler
OL,20,     Ffamily say their goodbyes. David
OL,21,     Fmakes a horrifying discovery.
